{% comment %}
  DEVATVA.IN - REFUND & RETURN POLICY SECTION
{% endcomment %}

<div class="page-width page-width--narrow" style="padding: 40px 20px; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; color: #292524;">
  <h1 style="font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 2.2rem; color: #1c1917; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;">
    Refund & Return Policy
  </h1>
  <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #78716c; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    7-Day Easy Replacement & Hassle-Free Returns Guarantee
  </p>

  <div style="line-height: 1.8; font-size: 1rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: #b45309; margin-bottom: 8px;">1. 7-Day Easy Return & Replacement</h2>
      <p>We stand behind the authenticity and quality of our Govt. Lab-Certified Rudrakshas, Gemstones, and Sacred Idols. If you receive a damaged item, defect, or incorrect product, you are eligible for a 100% free replacement or refund within 7 days of delivery.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: #b45309; margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Return Eligibility Criteria</h2>
      <p>To be eligible for a return or exchange, the item must be unused, in its original condition, with the original laboratory authenticity certificate, tag, and packaging intact.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: #b45309; margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Refund Process</h2>
      <p>Once your returned item is received and inspected, your refund will be processed back to your original payment method (or Bank Account / UPI for COD orders) within 3–5 business days.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: #b45309; margin-bottom: 8px;">4. How to Request a Return</h2>
      <p>Contact us via WhatsApp or email <strong>support@divyatva.com</strong> with your Order ID and photo/video of the item to initiate a replacement pickup.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

